{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Move to object, pick it up, check properties, complete specific task, or scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />",
    "BT": {
